 "lines": [
  "Your defender has a weakness. Find it.",
  "I broke down Lamine Yamal. Four habits to copy.",
  "He's young, but he studies the game like a coach.",
  "One. He studies his full-back during the game.",
  "He saw he was faster, so he kept going down the line.",
  "Two. He cuts onto his left and slips it to the runners.",
  "Not just the dribble. The pass after the cut.",
  "Three. He tracks back with his full-back.",
  "In one half I watched, his full-back never faced a two-v-one.",
  "Four. In his own third, keep it simple.",
  "He lost a few balls there trying to dribble. Don't copy that part.",
  "So next game, spend the first ten minutes testing your defender.",
  "Follow for the next one. The free analysis test is in my bio."
